			"notes": "# Changelog\n\n### Direct Username Query & Offline Server Support\n- **Faster Profile Loading (1 Request)**: Queries VNList API directly by username, skipping unnecessary Mojang API round-trips.\n- **Full Crack/Offline Server Support**: Correctly displays player tiers by in-game username without Mojang UUID dependency.\n- **No Mojang API Limits**: Reduced lookup latency from ~1500ms down to ~100ms.\n\n### Bug Fixes\n- **Fixed False Outage Warnings**: Fixed a bug where HTTP 429 (Rate Limit) triggered false \"VNList might be down\" chat warnings.\n- **Silent Rate Limit Retry**: Automatically backs off and retries after 5 seconds on 429 without spamming chat."
		},
