			"notes": "# VTiers\n> A lightweight Minecraft mod for displaying player tier information, powered by VNList.\n\n## Features\n\n- **VNList Integration** — Uses VNList as the primary tier data source.\n- **In-Game Tier Information** — Quickly view player tier data directly in Minecraft.\n- **Lightweight** — Designed to provide tier information without unnecessary overhead.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- Minecraft: `1.21.1`\n- Loader: `Fabric`"
